{
    "Id": "LoreBigMAC",
    "Name": "McCarron's Armoured Cavalry",
    "Details": "Also known as The Big Mac or simply abbreviated MAC, McCarron's Armored Cavalry are one of the largest and most successful mercenary commands in existence with an excellent battlefield reputation. McCarron's Armoured Cavalry is known as a restless commnd, being far more comfortable with attacking and raiding than defending. McCarron's Armoured Cavalry command structure is exceptionally loose and informal, which seems to work to their advantage. Despite their excellent combat record, the Big Mac has a mixed reputation off the battlefield as they are generally perceived as greedy troublemakers.
